values (already validated by `_as_choice` in `src/rebar/_config_sections.py`).\n\n## Testing\nRun `.venv/bin/pytest tests/unit/test_plan_review_engine_switch.py -q`. Happy path: the existing tests still pass. Failure path: each of the three values raises `ConfigError`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_plan_review_engine_switch.py` defines `test_explicit_engine_is_case_and_whitespace_sensitive`, parametrized over `\"Agentic\"`, `\"PIPELINE\"` and `\" pipeline\"`, asserting `ConfigError` with the value in its message.\n- [ ] `.venv/bin/pytest tests/unit/test_plan_review_engine_switch.py -q` exits 0.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_plan_review_engine_switch.py","reason":"add the case/whitespace-sensitivity test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"c3395950-bcc9-480a-af3e-9e0a4150600c","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["verify-scratch"],"ticket_id":"2fdf-ee49-14d4-48d8","ticket_type":"task","title":"[verify] engine check - safe to close","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["662b70a0-8e19-40df-866c-46488cff243b","499e842d-d14e-4d0c-97bc-da9c9ad4ac8c","5f687c8e-9bce-4ab8-b94b-433039917906","fb5cbfe2-1bf4-424a-a918-64b236481dd3","e4f1fdb1-f68c-4c07-a373-80b236bd251d","c3395950-bcc9-480a-af3e-9e0a4150600c","a6cfc9a2-1218-4ed9-947e-9ca308e1f478"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794591736717308943,"uuid":"50b3d2be-a82c-4c3a-81b7-ab4245d83675"}